{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A verifier failure can stop the run and suppress actionable review feedback when the review requests changes."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"After a restart at a different commit, an earlier commit's retry can deny the new verification its alternative-model attempt and unnecessarily stop the run."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"After a restart, the retry can repeat the freshly blocked verifier instead of trying another model, potentially stopping a run that could otherwise proceed."}]}